{"canonical_record":{"canonical_payload_sha256":"26238957cdc074f14ce641546ffa2204910e531dfc09c774350af9a42d7fa723","full_review_record_id":"fullrev_725a3867d396c88dad468ef6287b0bd177b0c6cd9decaea7d399aadd69279f67","overall_assessment":"The paper presents a technical method for 3D surface reconstruction and includes a brief statement regarding the environmental impact of computational resources. The supplied evidence is insufficient to determine broader policy compliance, data licensing details beyond the BlendedMVS license, or the presence of specific ethical risk pathways.","paper_id":"D7bPRxNt_AP","paper_identity_sha256":"5766d3463f696233b3c590d222c536e0305c42a14635040d74c00a598e11747b","prompt_identity_sha256":"ebeeae3e9934d974a72c1d098424df33d017432d3891bb030390547734677def","raw_response_sha256":"e8274d64c188ac58a2416da4a1ea5f099120797681dd1b9cddea89c60d4a790a","request_identity_sha256":"ed8a87afce58aa0c13190bd385f5ed727b8f2f954ef405948215be9c4a37523c","reviewer_identity_sha256":"c1cd7c7fdd4a2cbeb45c2f21af982ad0f30bffae8ae148e3eba36479685cf360","role":"POL","schema_version":"agentreview-full-review-corpus-v4","structural_context_sha256":"7b1ffcb2585b0de5c47044924ab077aad0c8b14b4c0ed5250c92e7aedb856755","subdimension_sections":[{"paper_anchor_ids":["SRC-034"],"review_text":"The paper does not identify a material ethical-risk pathway such as concrete harm, fairness, bias, or dual-use concerns specific to the reconstruction of inanimate objects. The authors include a brief statement in the conclusion acknowledging that the method requires significant computational resources, which they note can be a concern for global climate change. No further discussion of ethical risks or mitigation strategies is provided.","subdimension_id":"POL-ETH"},{"paper_anchor_ids":["SRC-025"],"review_text":"The paper utilizes the DTU dataset and the BlendedMVS dataset. The text explicitly notes that the BlendedMVS dataset is under a CC-4 License. The paper does not provide specific details regarding the licensing terms of the DTU dataset or the two additional thin objects captured by the authors. No claims regarding human data, privacy, or consent are made, as the data consists of 3D object scans.","subdimension_id":"POL-DAT"},{"paper_anchor_ids":["SRC-001"],"review_text":"The paper is submitted under the title 'Anonymous Author(s)' with placeholder fields for affiliation, address, and email. This formatting is consistent with double-blind submission practices. The supplied evidence does not include a frozen venue anonymity policy, so a formal compliance judgment cannot be made, but no self-identifying information is visible in the provided text.","subdimension_id":"POL-ANO"},{"paper_anchor_ids":[],"review_text":"The supplied paper-only evidence is insufficient to determine plagiarism or dual submission status. The paper cites concurrent work (UNISURF) and prior state-of-the-art methods, but no auditable evidence of textual overlap, uncredited reuse, or parallel submission is present in the text to support a finding of misconduct or originality.","subdimension_id":"POL-PLG"},{"paper_anchor_ids":["SRC-034"],"review_text":"The paper includes a brief 'Negative societal impact' statement in the conclusion, noting the computational resource requirements and their potential impact on climate change. No broader-impact checklist, IRB approval, or specific software/data license identifiers beyond the BlendedMVS CC-4 license are provided. The supplied evidence does not include a frozen policy obligation requiring specific compliance documents, so the absence of these items is noted as a limitation of the provided text rather than a policy violation.","subdimension_id":"POL-IMP"}]},"disposition":"CANONICAL_FULL_REVIEW_COMMITTED","item_commit_sha256":"50ab97a392f3acacfdc3d1240219b6c26d8dac8eeb32988de2eb6f28ae28e361","paper_id":"D7bPRxNt_AP","paper_ordinal":111,"raw_attempts":[{"assistant_content_base64":"","assistant_content_sha256":"e8274d64c188ac58a2416da4a